# ── One-off import tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scripts used to pull assets out of the old Shopify store and sort them. Not
# part of the running app. download_shopify_files.py additionally carries an
# ACCESS_TOKEN line, which is reason enough on its own.
